public import LeanTheory.Theory.Life.MergeChain

/-!
# The merge chain entered from the side

The side input of the OR gate (report `R-29`; the residues used by the layout of `R-31`) releases
the same glider as the through input, `134` generations after it arrives (`134 ≡ 254` modulo
`30`), so a chain of OR gates carries a side input like a through input (`chain_side_reaction`).
Generated by `scripts/life_cert/side_data.py` (untrusted); the certificates are checked here.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

@[expose] public section

namespace LeanTheory.Life

open Finset

